  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#downloading-resources\r\n\r\nIn the case of cross-origin content with no Content-Disposition: attachment,\r\nwhich of the following is expected?\r\n\r\nA) Browser ignores the entire download attribute (no download)\r\nB) Browser ignores the attribute value (do download but file name suggestion is ignored)\r\n\r\nFirefox and Safari follows A, but Chrome follows B, so there seems to be a confusion.\r\nAny suggestions?",
